{
    "Description": {
        "Id": "event_co_BageleMech_R2",
        "Name": "Bagele's Ride",
        "Details": "The incoming transmission alert flashes across your command console during an otherwise uneventful transit day aboard the <i>Argo</i>.\r\n\r\nDarius glances at the console and immediately groans.\r\n\r\n \"Commander... it's him again.\"\r\n\r\nBefore you can ask who, the pirate's face appears on the screen, looking entirely too pleased with himself. \"Commander! My favorite potential customer! I hope you're having a profitable day because I certainly am.\"\r\n\r\n You immediately notice the customized Hatchetman visible behind him.\r\n\r\n The pirate notices your eyes drift toward it and grins.\r\n\r\n \"Ah yes. She's still here. Still beautiful. Still taking up valuable hangar space.\"\r\n\r\n At the mention of the BattleMech, Bagele practically materializes beside your command station. \"You still have it?!\" Bagele blurts out.\r\n\r\n \"Of course I still have it.\" the pirate replies. \"I'm a businessman, not a savage.\" The pirate pats the Hatchetman's leg affectionately. \"I've kept her safe. Maintained. Protected from thieves, scavengers, and my own mechanics. Do you have any idea how difficult that last one is?\"\r\n\r\n You fold your arms.\r\n\r\n \"Get to the point.\"\r\n\r\n \"Yes, yes, Ok.\" The pirate produces a datapad. \"The current storage and maintenance costs remain exactly as promised. Three million C-Bills.\"\r\n\r\n Bagele visibly relaxes.\r\n\r\n \"Wait... it hasn't gone up?\"\r\n\r\n \"Not yet.\" The pirate shrugs. \"I'm either incredibly patient or incredibly stupid. The jury remains divided.\" He points toward the Hatchetman. \"So, Commander. Three million C-Bills and your friend gets reunited with his beloved BattleMech. Or we continue this delightful conversation at a later date.\"\r\n\r\n Bagele looks hopefully toward you.\r\n\r\n The pirate leans back in his chair. \"What's it going to be?\"",
        "Icon": "uixTxrSpot_BageleMech.png"
    },
