                        "Name": "Acceptance.",
                        "Details": "You look toward Bagele, then back to the screen.\r\n\r\n \"Fine. Three million. Transfer the Hatchetman.\"\r\n\r\n Bagele freezes.\r\n\r\n \"Wait... really?\"\r\n\r\n \"Really.\" you state.\r\n\r\n The pirate immediately claps his hands together. \"Commander, today you demonstrate remarkable intelligence and impeccable taste.\"\r\n\r\n \"Don't make me regret it.\" you glower at the pirate\r\n\r\n \"Too late. You already bought a Hatchetman from pirates.\"\r\n\r\n Bagele doesn't seem to hear the rest of the conversation, staring at the image of his BattleMech with a grin stretching from ear to ear.\r\n\r\n \"I'll arrange delivery by the end of the day.\" the pirate says. \"Pleasure doing business with you once again.\"\r\n\r\nThe transmission ends with Bagele still smiling at the now-blank screen.",
