                        "Id": "outcome_1_0",
                        "Name": "Need More Time.",
                        "Details": "You shake your head slowly. \"Not today.\"\r\n\r\n The pirate sighs dramatically. \"Commander, do you know how difficult it is to explain to people why I'm storing a customized Hatchetman that nobody is buying?\"\r\n\r\n \"You'll survive.\" you state flatly. \r\n\r\n \"Probably.\"\r\n\r\n Bagele closes his eyes and rubs his temples. \"You're still considering it though?\"\r\n\r\n \"I'm still considering it.\"\r\n\r\n The pirate nods slowly. \"Very well. Three million remains today's storage and maintenance fee.\" He points a finger at the screen. \"Today being the important word there.\"\r\n\r\n Bagele groans loudly.\r\n\r\n \"Please don't encourage him.\" you say, looking at Bagele.\r\n\r\n The pirate ignores him. \"Take your time, Commander. Just remember that every businessman eventually gets tired of being reasonable.\"\r\n\r\nThe transmission terminates, leaving Bagele looking only slightly less worried than before.",
